      "content": "Doubling your dose without medical guidance is not a safe approach, as it could cause your blood pressure to drop too low, leading to more serious issues. While some people need dose adjustments, only a qualified healthcare provider can determine the correct amount for you. If you are concerned about the side effects, you can often call your doctor's office for a quick advice line instead of waiting for a full appointment.",
      "source": "target",
