      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is completely understandable that you are worried, but trying to self-adjust your medication is a risky gamble with your health. If your blood pressure is truly not controlled, a higher dose could be prescribed, but jumping to 20mg on your own could cause a dangerous dip in pressure. For immediate relief or to assess your current status, consider using a home blood pressure monitor to take readings before and after the dizziness occurs. If you feel this is an emergency, please seek immediate medical attention.",
      "source": "target",
